{"id":"tree-diameter","title":"Diameter of a binary tree","difficulty":"easy","pattern":"return one thing, record another","statement":"<p>Return the number of edges on the longest path between any two nodes (the path need not pass through the root).</p>","entry":{"python":"diameter","cpp":{"name":"diameterOfBinaryTree","ret":"int","params":[["TreeNode*","root"]]}},"kind":"function","compare":"exact","time_limit_ms":2000,"hints":["The longest path through a node = height(left) + height(right).","Return heights from the recursion; update a global best on the side."],"complexity":"O(n)","starter":{"python":"def diameter(root):\n    pass\n","cpp":"int diameterOfBinaryTree(TreeNode* root) {\n    \n}\n"},"tests":[{"args":[[1,2,3,4,5]],"expected":3,"sample":true},{"args":[[1,2]],"expected":1,"sample":true},{"args":[[1]],"expected":0},{"args":[[]],"expected":0},{"args":[[1,2,null,3,4,5,null,6,null,null,7]],"expected":5},{"args":[[16,79,21,null,68,90,null,-44,75,80,-95,null,94,20,null,92,-80,null,null,37,-84,null,null,10,46,null,null,72,-10,-7,null,-3,46,86,null,null,25,-1,-82,17,-71,-68,-68,24,87,-6,20,null,12,null,-75,-22,null,null,-65,-11,46,null,-37,null,78,-79,-24,-3,32,42,53,98,null,-39,-52,0,0,null,null,28,-67,51,50,null,-72,-50,-58,null,19,null,-3,-33,-7,27,17,null,75,62,null,-83,-54,null,57,79,100,null,97,null,33,90,31,-43,-84,-38,-23,40,-66,-9,-73,85,null,null,-78,12,67,58,-87,-21,-60,98,null,null,90,-74,null,-6,-31,38,-34,19,37,-24,null,-56,-20,21,-73,null,26,-15,-47,null,90,24,35,-58,20,7,4,-79,53,null,null,97,-91,null,84,29,22,-68,null,-99,49,98,32,81,null,27,-93,-48,-61,-89,27,51,null,null,null,66,-47,48,-58,-55,-1,38,null,-40,-84,-83,13,-79,16,-55,67,41,24,null,-64,7,99,null,86,11,null,63,-24,9,-49,-1,0,77,95,-53,3,-72,-96,-100,-49,91,73,46,41,47,46,56,-15,71,-73,null,60,null,null,null,19,-37,20,61,96,-93,-77,-80,-83,null,-13,-33,-34,-57,-50,44,82,-25,-27,17,73,48,96,85,86,null,-79,22,-12,-76,71,56,null,74,-100,-54,-62,50,94,-47,52,-70,-13,null,-28,8,-54,16,-